  "_README": [
    "This is the only file you edit. Everything on the page comes from here.",
    "",
    "updated  — the date shown under each entry. Bump it when you change numbers.",
    "stats    — max 3 per gateway. Fewer is fine. value is shown large, label small.",
    "           Write value exactly as it should appear, separators included: \"2,324\".",
    "posters  — max 5 per gateway. Direct image URLs. Fewer is fine; a slot is",
    "           drawn only where there is a cover, and no covers means no strip.",
    "           ORDER MATTERS: the first one is what you are on right now, and",
    "           the page rings it. Put the current one first.",
    "",
    "photo    — the round portrait above the title. photoAlt is what a screen",
    "           reader announces. Remove both keys to drop the portrait.",
    "",
    "backdrop — swap the art by dropping new files in media/ and pointing these",
    "           paths at them. credit is the artist and is shown in the colophon.",
    "",
    "After editing, run `node scripts/bake.mjs` so the page still reads when it",
    "is opened straight off the disk."
